ShoalCave_Text_OfferEbb:
	.string "The water's turning.\n"
	.string "Want to wait for the ebb?$"

ShoalCave_Text_OfferFlood:
	.string "The water's turning.\n"
	.string "Want to wait for the flood?$"

ShoalCave_Text_LowTideOffers:
	.string "The sea draws back.\p"
	.string "SHOAL SALT shows in the mud, and\n"
	.string "the stairs, the lower room and the\l"
	.string "ice room stand open.$"

ShoalCave_Text_HighTideOffers:
	.string "The sea comes in.\p"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS line the flooded\n"
	.string "shelves of the inner room.$"

ShoalCave_Text_TideWaits:
	.string "The water will wait for you.\n"
	.string "Say the word whenever you like.$"

ShoalCave_Text_Materials:
	.string "Bring four SHOAL SALTS and four\n"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS from this cave.\p"
	.string "Your first haul earns GLALITITE,\n"
	.string "a Mega Stone for GLALIE. Wear a\l"
	.string "MEGA RING and it's yours.\p"
	.string "The second haul buys my chart of\n"
	.string "the deep ice. After that, salt and\l"
	.string "shells buy furniture for your base.$"

ShoalCave_Text_ConfirmExchange:
	.string "Trade four SHOAL SALTS and four\n"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS for a {STR_VAR_1}?$"

ShoalCave_Text_RewardBag:
	.string "The materials are perfect!\n"
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1} is in your BAG.$"

ShoalCave_Text_RewardPC:
	.string "The materials are perfect!\n"
	.string "Your {STR_VAR_1} is in your item PC.$"

ShoalCave_Text_ConfirmCharting:
	.string "Another full haul? Then I'll chart\n"
	.string "the deep ice for you.\p"
	.string "Trade four SHOAL SALTS and four\n"
	.string "SHOAL SHELLS for the chart?$"

ShoalCave_Text_Charted:
	.string "The chart is yours.\p"
	.string "Something rare is stirring in the\n"
	.string "ice room. Go and meet it.$"

ShoalCave_Text_WhichDecoration:
	.string "Salt and shells buy furniture now.\n"
	.string "Which piece would you like?$"

ShoalCave_Text_DecorationTraded:
	.string "A fair trade. It's waiting in your\n"
	.string "decoration PC.$"

ShoalCave_Text_NoRoom:
	.string "Your storage is full.\n"
	.string "Keep your materials until there's room.$"

ShoalCave_Text_Declined:
	.string "No hurry. Bring them back whenever\n"
	.string "you're ready to trade.$"

ShoalCave_Text_WasShoalSaltNowNothing:
	.string "There was some SHOAL SALT here.\n"
	.string "But, there's nothing here now.$"

ShoalCave_Text_WasShoallShellNowNothing:
	.string "There was a SHOAL SHELL here.\n"
	.string "But, there's nothing here now.$"

@ ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
@ Inclement Emerald Shoal Cave Shell Bell maker dialogue, restored because the
@ Inclement Shoal Cave scripts reference these 8 symbols. Additive only: the
@ two symbols this file shares with the donor
@ (ShoalCave_Text_WasShoalSaltNowNothing, ShoalCave_Text_WasShoallShellNowNothing)
@ keep their existing Emerald Champions text and were NOT taken from the donor.
@ ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_AreYouPlanningOnGoingInThere: @ 82A7E0E
	.string "Are you planning on going deep\n"
	.string "in there?\p"
	.string "How about bringing me back some\n"
	.string "Shoal Salt and Shoal Shells?\p"
	.string "I can make you something good if\n"
	.string "you bring me the ingredients.$"

ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_BringMe4ShoalSaltAndShells: @ 82A7EB3
	.string "If you bring me four each of the\n"
	.string "Shoal Salt and Shoal Shells,\l"
	.string "I can make you a Shell Bell…\p"
	.string "You can get those ingredients\n"
	.string "every day.$"

ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_WouldYouLikeShellBell: @ 82A7F37
	.string "Oh, hey! Shoal Salt and Shoal Shells!\n"
	.string "And enough of them, too!\p"
	.string "Would you like me to make you\n"
	.string "a Shell Bell with them?$"

ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_MakeShellBellRightAway: @ 82A7FAC
	.string "All righty, then! I'll make you\n"
	.string "a Shell Bell right away.\p"
	.string "… … … … … … … …\n"
	.string "… … … … … … … …\p"
	.string "There! Done!$"

ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_Slowbronite:
	.string "And…\n"
	.string "I'm not quite sure what this is,\l"
	.string "but I got this recently.\p"
	.string "If you like, please take this, too.$"

ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_ExplainShellBell: @ 82A8012
	.string "Have a Pokémon hold on to that.\n"
	.string "It'll love it, that's for certain.\p"
	.string "Why, the Shell Bell's chime…\n"
	.string "It's simply sublime!\p"
	.string "You can get its ingredients every day,\n"
	.string "so I can make you more.$"

ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_WantedToMakeShellBell: @ 82A80C6
	.string "Oh… Is that so…\n"
	.string "I wanted to make a Shell Bell…$"

ShoalCave_LowTideEntranceRoom_Text_NoSpaceInYourBag: @ 82A80F5
	.string "You don't have space in your Bag\n"
	.string "if I were to make it for you.\p"
	.string "You should make room and come back\n"
	.string "for a Shell Bell.$"
